  "attack_surface": "Bi-tight for Paley p\u22655 needs \u2016\u03ba\u2016_F\u00b2\u226496n (\u21d4 \u2211M\u00b2\u2264Wick) in addition to mult\u2265d\u22121 (now proved for Paley). Then 15.98.5 closes gap/bi-tight. Upgrade mult to d via Ky Fan maximizers (15.97) optional for 16N-scale bounds. Alternates: 16N/H. Deep ND still required for lim \u03b1_n.",
  "verdict": "Prop 15.98 proves mult(\u03bb\u2082)\u2265d\u22121 for Paley Max+ (PSL(2,p\u00b2) min irrep dim) and the algebra mult\u2265d\u22121+\u2016\u03ba\u2016\u00b2\u226496n\u21d2gap for all primes p\u22655. Certified p=3,5. Remaining OPEN for bi-tight: \u2016\u03ba\u2016\u00b2\u226496n for general p\u22655. lim \u03b1_n OPEN (need \u03ba bound + deep ND).",
  "settlement_note": "Next: prove \u2016\u03ba\u2016_F\u00b2\u226496n for all primes p\u22655 (boolean \u2264 Wick on Max+). Then bi-tight empty for Paley p\u22655 via 15.98. Then N_DEEP + Main Theorem. L stays OPEN until then.",
